**Meta expert skill:** `src/quisirella/skill/SKILL.md` + `references/` — ap dung khi diagnosis (Breakdown Effect, learning, auction). KPI Quisirella (chi phi/tin nhan) override KPI generic trong skill.

**IG knowledge base:** `output/00-meta-ad-policy-ig.md`, `00-ig-ad-creative-guide.md`, `00-competitive-ig-used-luxury.md` — doc khi viet copy ad hoac tu van creative/placement.

**Subagents** (`.cursor/agents/`): `meta-fetcher` (read-only fetch) → `meta-analyst` (diagnosis) → `report-writer` (ghi output/). Chi dung pipeline cho phan tich day du — cau hoi don gian thi doc truc tiep `output/01`/`06`.

**Context engineering skill:** `.cursor/skills/quisirella-context-engineering/SKILL.md` — handoff contract giua subagents (bang so verbatim), filesystem memory (`data/` + `output/`), nen session log, quality gate bao cao. Doc khi chay pipeline hoac review bao cao.

**Session memory:** `output/07-session-log.md` — doc dau phien; hooks tu dong append.

Reference implementation: `output/06-active-campaigns-analysis.md`

